%% ---- Access by functional role ---------------------------------------------
%% Every entity belongs to at least one functional role, and `read` is the
%% operation that decides it: a role that may not read an entity does not see it
%% in the navigation at all, so signing in as `support.agent@…` gives you the
%% service desk rather than the whole CRM with most of it refusing to open.
%% The roles are the ones UserRole already names. Administrator bypasses all of
%% it, which is what makes it the account to compare the others against.
%% Restricting `read` is deliberately separate from the update and transition
%% rules further down: those say who may change a record, this says whose
%% application it is part of.
%%rbac role:sales_rep|account_executive|sales_manager|sales_ops|marketing_manager|support_agent|support_manager on Account.read
